Subject: Re: Semtools longitudinal partial invariance syntax
Message-ID: <FkxBZUEiKlI.dLSjY0rqAAAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <FkxBZUEiKlI.LgdPn5lqDgAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
