bfcc=~ NA*ies3_10 + ies3_11 + ies3_12
upe ~~ epr + rhsc + bfcc
epr ~~ rhsc + bfcc
rhsc ~~ bfcc
upe ~~ 1*upe
epr ~~ 1*epr
rhsc ~~ 1*rhsc
